---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Text Club Enrollment
description: Join the Uptown Car Wash Text Club and be the first to know about special promotions, discounts, and events in San Diego.
permalink: /text-club/
---

{#
  ============================================================================
  STEP TO FINISH THIS PAGE:
  In FlexWash, open your Marketing / Single Use promotion, click the Embed
  (iFrame) option, and copy ONLY the URL out of its src="..." attribute.
  Paste that URL between the quotes below. Nothing else needs to change.
  ============================================================================
#}
{% set flexwash_iframe_src = "https://app.flexwash.com/promotion-sign-up/promotion/2018" %}

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Join the Uptown Text Club</h1>
    <p>Be the first to know about special promotions, discounts, and events at Uptown Car Wash</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="legal-content">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="legal-text" style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;">

      <p>Sign up below to get exclusive offers sent straight to your phone — starting with a discount on
      your next wash.</p>

      {% if flexwash_iframe_src %}
      <div class="text-club-embed" style="position:relative;width:100%;margin:2rem 0;">
        <iframe
          src="{{ flexwash_iframe_src }}"
          title="Uptown Car Wash Text Club enrollment form"
          style="width:100%;min-height:500px;border:0;display:block;"
          loading="lazy"></iframe>
      </div>
      {% else %}
      <div style="margin:2rem 0;padding:1.25rem;border:3px dashed #c00;background:#fff4f4;color:#900;">
        <strong>NOT LIVE YET — FlexWash form not embedded.</strong>
        Paste the promotion iFrame URL into <code>flexwash_iframe_src</code> at the top of
        <code>src/pages/text-club.njk</code>, then rebuild. Do not submit this page to Twilio
        until the form renders here.
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.6;margin-top:1.5rem;">
        By submitting this form and signing up for texts you consent to receive marketing messages
        (promos &amp; reminders) from Uptown Car Wash. Consent is not a condition of purchase.
        Msg &amp; data rates may apply. Msg frequency varies. Unsubscribe anytime by replying STOP.
        <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy here</a>
      </p>

      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;">Questions? Call us at
        <a href="tel:{{ settings.phone_link }}">{{ settings.phone }}</a> or email
        <a href="mailto:{{ settings.email }}">{{ settings.email }}</a>.
      </p>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
